        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;graph TD\n    %% Title Box\n    Title[&lt;b&gt;ELMS — As-Is Leave Request Process&lt;/b&gt;]\n    style Title fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#666,stroke-width:2px\n    Title --- A\n\n    %% Main Flow\n    A([Employee Needs Leave]) --&gt; B[Employee Submits Leave Request &lt;br&gt; Email / Paper Form]\n    B --&gt; C[HR Receives Request]\n    C --&gt; D[HR Manually Checks Leave Balance &lt;br&gt; Excel / Leave Register]\n    D --&gt; E[HR Sends Request to Manager]\n    E --&gt; F[Manager Reviews Request]\n    F --&gt; G{Approve?}\n\n    %% YES Branch\n    G --&gt;|Yes| H[Manager Approves Request]\n    H --&gt; J[HR Updates Leave Record]\n\n    %% NO Branch\n    G --&gt;|No| I[Manager Rejects Request]\n    I --&gt; J\n\n    %% Common Ending Flow\n    J --&gt; K[HR Informs Employee]\n    K --&gt; L([Leave Process Completed])\n\n    %% Diagram Note / Key Issues\n    Note[&lt;b&gt;Key Issues:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Manual submission, manual balance checking, manual record updates, &lt;br&gt;approval delays, and limited status visibility.]\n    style Note fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656,stroke-width:1px,text-align:left\n    L --- Note\n\n    %% Styling Elements for Better Visuals\n    style A fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366,stroke-width:2px\n    style L fill:#f8cecc,stroke:#b85450,stroke-width:2px\n    style G fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656,stroke-width:2px\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="wXSJdGGXLqXaf2tpZzvb-1">
